WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.128
A Popkin has one album, and everyone adds to it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.779
Photos shows how many there are, and from how many people: forty-eight photos from

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:13.895
eleven people.

00:00:14.095 --> 00:00:16.801
They are grouped by day, the latest day first.

00:00:17.001 --> 00:00:21.386
The first photo of the latest day is twice the width and height of the others.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.945
Everyone shows all the photos.

00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:27.763
Mine shows only yours, and the filter is marked as pressed.

00:00:27.963 --> 00:00:32.585
With no photos yet, Photos explains the album and offers Add photos.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.372
Choose Add, and pick up to twenty photos from your device.

00:00:37.572 --> 00:00:40.455
A dialog shows each one, with a caption field.

00:00:40.655 --> 00:00:43.492
The action counts them: Add three photos.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.881
A photo can be up to ten megabytes. This file is fourteen: it is marked with the

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:51.622
reason and not uploaded. The others are.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.063
While photos upload, a progress bar shows how far, and the action reads Adding.

00:00:57.263 --> 00:01:02.154
If one fails, it stays in the dialog with Try again. The ones that succeeded are in

00:01:02.154 --> 00:01:03.043
the album.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.037
When someone else adds a photo, it appears in your album without a reload.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.526
Choose a photo, and it opens full screen on a dark background: who added it and

00:01:16.526 --> 00:01:20.035
when, the whole photo without cropping, and its caption.

00:01:20.235 --> 00:01:23.521
Swipe sideways, or press an arrow key, for the next one.

00:01:23.721 --> 00:01:26.872
Close, or Escape, returns you to the place you left.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.399
On a phone, the album is three photos across, and Add floats over it.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.353
From a tablet, four across, with Add photos in the header.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.584
On a laptop, five, beside the sidebar.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.052
Wider still, six.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.684
The photo grows too. On a laptop, who added it and the caption move to a panel

00:01:50.684 --> 00:01:52.005
beside the photo.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.938
What no screen shows, the tests prove: location and device data are removed from

00:01:58.938 --> 00:02:00.349
every stored file.

00:02:00.549 --> 00:02:05.384
Reactions, comments, saving and deleting come in journey fourteen. And a deployed

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:07.654
system still needs a photo store.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.521
That is journey five. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
